# Generated by the cycle pipeline. Never line-merge these: git will happily
# interleave rows from two runs and produce a series that belongs to neither,
# which is how 144 non-daily rows came back after a clean. A conflict here is
# the correct outcome — resolve it by re-running the scripts, not by editing.
cycles/data/*.csv   -merge -diff linguist-generated
public/cycles/*.json -merge -diff linguist-generated
cycles/REPORT.md    -merge
